Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:17.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:19.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,许多枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:21.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.62,0:00:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}That group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:25.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我遇见的女人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, the women I met.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.25,0:00:29.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们有武器库 有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have an armory. They have guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:32.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前怎么不跟我们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell us before now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:34.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做过保证 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a promise, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:42.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会想起你杀掉的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever think about who you've killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:01:00.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果计划失败 你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready if this goes south?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会失败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果失败了 你不必内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it does, you don't need to feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.75,0:01:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会内疚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.87,0:01:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.79,0:01:10.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:06.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得用一块防水布盖住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to cover this with a tarp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:08.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 防水布吗  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tarp? Tarp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.59,0:02:10.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:13.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接告诉我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:17.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要保温\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:20.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样它们就会在冬天来临之前发芽\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they'll put out shoots before the fast freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.56,0:02:21.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样的话 我们扯掉防水布\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, we pull back the tarp,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:22.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们就会自然死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}they die naturally,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.97,0:02:24.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不用一直除草了\N{\fnArial\fs30}saves on all the endless weeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:26.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去盖防水布吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to tarping.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 女老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, boss lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.52,0:02:31.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 你去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, wait. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:33.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是农民\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh -- I'm not a farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.86,0:02:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some help here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:39.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见外面生长着野生蓝莓灌木丛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a wild blueberry bush growing outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果足够嫩\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's young enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:42.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就要把它拔出来种在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna pull it up and replant it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:44.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好植株能结40多年的蓝莓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one will produce for over 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:47.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得开始规划活那么久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to start acting like we'll be around that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:53.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就盖防水布 别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tarp. Don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.88,0:02:55.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我来看看你做得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see how you do after.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.14,0:03:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上去后 注意信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you're up, watch for the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几点开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time does the clock start?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.03,0:03:15.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等她一进去就开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as she's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.33,0:03:23.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你来了 我知道这很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you came. I know it's been hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:48.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我知道你不想这样  - 我之前不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't want this. Didn't want this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.73,0:03:50.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我现在开始明白是怎么回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm starting to understand what's on the menu now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:52.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以像这些人一样躲藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can hide like these people,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以继续供奉救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can keep trying to serve The Saviors,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.07,0:03:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以时常看见你被毒打\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can watch you get randomly beaten every so often,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:57.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者我们可以反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or else we can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.15,0:03:58.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且跟你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And being with you, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:06.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让无助的恐惧可以容忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes abject terror tolerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.71,0:04:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该更努力地阻止罗西塔和萨沙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've tried harder to stop Rosita and Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:18.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她们再等我一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they'd have just waited one more day...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.51,0:04:20.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙枪法很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Sasha's a good shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗西塔知道如何照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Rosita knows how to take care of herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:25.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们也许现在都回山顶寨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably back at Hilltop right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我希望如此 我们需要她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Least I hope so. We're gonna need 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:31.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还得死很多人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a whole lot of people still got to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:48.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:51.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:55.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能给我点水喝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:08.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该自我介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:10.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm David.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.69,0:05:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你昨晚是否记得我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if you remember me from last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.02,0:05:17.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.03,0:05:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can forgive that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚简直一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night was kind of a shitstorm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是我把绳子递给那些人 把你绑起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the guy that gave the rope to the guys that tied you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:34.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总是带着一些绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always keep some close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:42.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用绳子能做许多有趣的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just all kinds of fun and interesting things you can do with rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.59,0:05:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 你真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you're pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:54.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我给你水喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I give you some water,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:58.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我不该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is not something I'm supposed to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意为我做点事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will you do something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做点你不该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something you're not supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:23.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你有多渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how thirsty you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:30.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:37.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反抗只会让过程更持久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting's just gonna make it last longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.45,0:06:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你 我无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, for the record, is fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}David!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:58.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里他妈干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:06:59.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan, sir --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:02.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得我需要你回答吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think I need you to answer that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:05.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能看出你想强奸这女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that you're trying to rape this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.30,0:07:09.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想强奸这女人 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were trying to rape this woman, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:20.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是不可接受的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some unacceptable behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:23.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强奸违反了这里的规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rape is against the rules here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:26.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想待在允许强奸的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't wanna be somewhere where it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:31.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,负责的人放过这种事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone in charge who let something like that fly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:41.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}David.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的越线了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really crossed a line here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:49.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:07:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.89,0:08:01.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不接受你的道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not accept your apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:17.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.79,0:08:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这名字真好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a beautiful name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给萨沙拿件新衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Sasha here a new T-shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:35.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你看到了这些 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you had to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.64,0:08:37.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对绳子的事我也很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry 'bout the rope, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:40.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许有些小题大做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably overkill,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你昨晚闹了好大一场事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you did cause one hell of a fracas last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:52.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:56.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:08:59.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.91,0:09:02.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:08.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死 我现在懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell. I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:11.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to hand it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:14.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这娘们真他妈有种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got some beach-ball-sized lady nuts on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:16.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不顾死活地就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming in all kamikaze like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:18.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big question here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:20.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I need the truth on this one --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.40,0:09:26.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是瑞克派你来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Rick put you up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:28.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:32.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的婊子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.53,0:09:34.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:39.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何 你肯定以为你必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, you must've thought it was gonna be the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:41.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟你独自那样闯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming in on your lonesome like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:44.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但事情不会这样发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not the way it's got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh-unh. Just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:47.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可能只是个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this could be the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:06.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀现在归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This knife is yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:09.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以试着使用 干掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can try to use it, take me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但考虑到我站在你上方\N{\fnArial\fs30}but considering I am standing above you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着一根棒球棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}holding a baseball bat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不是明智之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}that doesn't seem real smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:20.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以用刀来割腕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you can use it to slit your wrists,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:23.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就太可惜了 但我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}which would be a damn shame, but I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:26.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到最近发生的事 你显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're obviously not on the shiny side of the street,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:28.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是什么阳光女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}given recent events.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.09,0:10:31.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以坐在那里 什么也不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you can sit there and do nothin',
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.30,0:10:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等着老大卫复活 咬掉你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}wait for ol' David to come back to life and eat your face,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.05,0:10:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也很可惜 有些疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}also a damn shame and kinda nuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:40.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你有权做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, hell, to each their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者你可以用刀来干掉强奸犯老大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can use that blade and stop ol' Rapey Davey
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:51.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止他变成强奸犯行尸大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}from becoming Dead-Alive Rapey Davey,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.98,0:10:57.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己救自己 加入救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}save yourself, join the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.49,0:11:02.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我要拿你怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.08,0:11:05.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.71,0:11:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我少了个男丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a man short.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.17,0:11:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的 这个人渣其实算不上男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you can't really call this piece of shit a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但依然我少了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but still, I'm short,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你这娘们有种极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you got those beach-ball-sized lady nuts,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:19.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要好好利用你的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wanna harness the heat comin' off of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有朝一日你可以帮我掌管这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can help me run this place one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:28.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们所有人一起 跟着规矩走\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of us together, following the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:30.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站在同一战线\N{\fnArial\fs30}workin' on the same side of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:32.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来都是这么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all this was ever about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:35.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也依然可以选这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it still can be for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:38.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到我的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's hard to picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你难以想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.95,0:11:46.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 萨沙 人人都有不得不迈过去的坎\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Sasha, we all got shit to get over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花点时间 好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take some time. Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:59.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论你的决定如何 都由你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you decide, so it shall be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.01,0:12:00.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别有压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:04.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 再次道歉 很抱歉你不得不目睹那幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, again, I am sorry you had to see that,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:07.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我知道你是见过场面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though I know you have seen some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只希望你能明白…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are not monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:12:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.75,0:13:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're keepin' me safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:11.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你带了些能让你舒服点的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you some creature comforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.84,0:13:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实话说 这枕头不防过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full disclosure, the pillow is not hypoallergenic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:22.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于我该不该过来有过一些争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was some debate as to whether or not I should come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.18,0:13:25.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说假如我被你携刀劫持的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said in the event of a hostage situation with the pig sticker
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:27.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就只能靠自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I would fully be on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.11,0:13:30.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就这么一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanted to share that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.61,0:13:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼根向我传达了他对你的招安之意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negan relayed to me his offer to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.16,0:13:41.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我看来你应该接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my opinion that you should accept said offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.03,0:13:42.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:44.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这是不得己而为之的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's a hold-your-nose situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.91,0:13:46.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但与这里的头头做朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}but taking up with the management here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:48.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是正确的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}was indeed the correct select.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:54.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经认为自己可以勇敢起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I believed I could be brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:57.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当一个亚伯拉罕那样的生存者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I could be a survivor like Abraham was,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:01.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开着那辆房车驶向夕阳是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ridin' that RV into the sunset was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一生中最棒的37分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of the greatest 37 minutes of my existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:09.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我如今明白那只是一个完全不切实际的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know now that I was full-tilt delusional.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这辈子最害怕的一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never in my life been as scared
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.57,0:14:16.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那晚在那个林子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I was that night in the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.28,0:14:18.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跪在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}kit to the grit,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.24,0:14:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得自己死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}fully believing my number's about to be called,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:24.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后看见勇敢的生存者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}then seeing it happen to someone brave...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.87,0:14:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...to a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:30.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后那种让人吓尿裤子的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the pants-pissing terror
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:33.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着那个场景一次又一次地出现…\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the rinse and repeat of that very same event --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.05,0:14:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.97,0:14:44.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来这边意味着我再也不用恐惧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being here means I'll never have to again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你答应的话 你也不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And neither will you if you just say "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.27,0:14:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你答应吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please say "yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:14:56.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他希望你能答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would want you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.33,0:15:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:07.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.25,0:15:10.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们依然活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世道已经变了 我们可以随之做出改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things have changed. We can change with 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.71,0:15:14.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.94,0:15:38.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他已经开始…  - 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh, starting to...  Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:34.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还从没见过你到墙外来昵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think I've seen you outside the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.21,0:16:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建这些围墙就是为了用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I built these walls to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.00,0:16:42.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如我想吃绿菜了 我可以吃沙拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I want greenery, I eat a salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.18,0:16:45.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本打算找你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping we could talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:47.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我看见你一个人跑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I saw you come out here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.68,0:16:49.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.19,0:16:55.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:59.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在找需要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're looking for something they need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.19,0:17:07.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是好奇 你怎么还留在这 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm just wondering -- Why you still here, Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:10.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡森已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Carson gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.37,0:17:12.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你要救他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you were gonna get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:15.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That not true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是只是说说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it just something you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:21.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬 你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, you've got to start trusting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:23.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们都很紧张 很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, people are tense, they're worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:25.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们表现得像统一战线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody'd be a hell of a lot better...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家会感觉好得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we could present a-a united front.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:33.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能真正统一战线 会轻松得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be a lot easier if we actually were a united front.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.81,0:17:34.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.27,0:17:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得对合作持更开放的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to be more open to working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:41.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.57,0:17:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不从希望我们之间闹成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never intended for things between us to come to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.15,0:17:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.74,0:17:52.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亡羊补牢永远不算晚 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never too late to change. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:01.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是认真的 我稍后会去找你详谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're serious, I'll come by later and we can talk more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:02.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:03.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:13.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为很快就能完事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought this'd just take a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.64,0:18:16.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄完之前你 能帮我留意一下四周吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind keeping an eye out while I finish up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.64,0:18:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:19.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乐意之至\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.57,0:19:08.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:09.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.24,0:19:14.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来保护孕妇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, uh...I'm here to protect the pregnant lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:16.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用孕妇保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need the pregnant lady to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:19.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前杀过行尸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever killed one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没杀过我就不可能站在这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be here if I hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:29.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没事 我来吧  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine. I got it.  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:42.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.91,0:20:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.21,0:20:08.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:19.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:32.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他以前没杀过行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't killed one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:34.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.95,0:20:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我们可不是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what he told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.91,0:20:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.18,0:21:01.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己抓到的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. You catch that yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.56,0:21:03.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那他妈当然  - 瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, yeah. Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 那当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.19,0:21:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去把它清理干净  - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna go clean it.  Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别出声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay quiet
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:31.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手放在头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put your hands on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:34.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在村里时我们就该杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should've just killed you in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.59,0:21:38.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会庆幸你们没杀我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be glad you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.47,0:21:40.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是一个人来的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not alone, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.76,0:21:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.35,0:21:44.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让你坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 辛蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cyndie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:01.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你保证过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:03.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我保证过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.41,0:22:04.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把手放在头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.00,0:22:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:16.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.09,0:22:20.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了 我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.18,0:22:23.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你们有 你俩都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do, both of you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.22,0:22:24.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的同伴现在就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends are out there right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:26.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会攻占这里 希望不必开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're gonna take this place, hopefully without firing a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.56,0:22:29.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你们要“攻占这里”\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You're gonna "take this place"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.27,0:22:30.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:31.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你们的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.69,0:22:32.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.61,0:22:34.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要抵抗救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna fight The Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.48,0:22:35.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们应该加入我们  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should join us.   No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救世军杀害了你们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Saviors killed your fathers,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.69,0:22:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 丈夫 儿子 而你们选择逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}your brothers, husbands, sons, and you ran from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.86,0:22:42.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们铲除了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we got rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.20,0:22:44.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碧翠丝说还有更多救世军 她说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beatrice said there was more out there, and she was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.45,0:22:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.58,0:22:47.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.83,0:22:50.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我的女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.96,0:22:53.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接管了我们 夺走了我们的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took us over. They took everything from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.38,0:22:56.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们对救世军千依百顺\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do whatever The Saviors tell us to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.42,0:22:58.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们以为我们还是那样 但不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they think we're still doing that, but we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.05,0:22:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们打算反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.80,0:23:01.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他社区加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have other communities beside us,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:03.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了海边旅馆 我们就有了一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with Oceanside, we would have an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:05.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“谢谢给枪 你们应该加入我们“\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thanks for the guns. You should join us"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.27,0:23:10.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们联手 可以打败他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we fight them together, we can beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.14,0:23:11.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.14,0:23:14.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会赢的 塔拉 我见过 你也见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll win, Tara. I've seen it. So have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.15,0:23:16.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我们团队的首领谈谈 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just talk to the leader of my group, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.48,0:23:18.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只用谈谈 我们不必占领这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just talk, and we don't have to take over this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.23,0:23:19.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不想那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.28,0:23:20.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以给他们信号停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give them the signal to stop this,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.82,0:23:23.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你必须现在就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have to tell me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我们不只是藏在树林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen. We're not just hiding in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.91,0:23:30.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在做事 我们没有放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing something. We're not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.50,0:23:33.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想打破我的承诺 辛蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to break my promise, Cyndie, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.42,0:23:36.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是世界可以属于好人 公正的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the world can belong to good people, to fair people,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.63,0:23:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我们有足够的勇气去尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we're all just brave enough to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.71,0:23:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是好人 也不勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not good, and we are not brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.30,0:23:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你我都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither you nor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.88,0:23:44.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.09,0:23:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才有现在这麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.05,0:23:48.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉 如果你们拿走我们的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Tara, if you take our guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.47,0:23:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不如把我们全杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might as well be killing us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.06,0:23:51.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你们做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you'll be doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.60,0:23:53.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该和他们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.35,0:23:54.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.48,0:23:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以试着阻止这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can try to stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.15,0:23:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 辛蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Cyndie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.99,0:24:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.66,0:24:05.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没法阻止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.83,0:24:12.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.54,0:24:17.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arsenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.02,0:24:35.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趴下 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.56,0:24:38.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手抱头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those hands -- Put them on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.15,0:24:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.67,0:25:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人杀我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people killing my people?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.72,0:25:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炸弹在墙外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bombs were outside the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.68,0:25:08.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你本可以阻止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've stopped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.47,0:25:10.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望所有人都没事 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I hope everyone is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.26,0:25:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. They better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.26,0:25:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.47,0:25:14.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.40,0:25:21.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.23,0:25:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住 后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop. Back up. Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.98,0:25:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛蒂 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyndie, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.45,0:25:33.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是空的 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's empty. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.29,0:25:34.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unloaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.83,0:25:37.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是来伤人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't come here to hurt anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.75,0:25:39.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛蒂 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyndie, give it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.79,0:25:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.05,0:25:45.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔尼亚 就和瑞克谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natania, just talk to Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.42,0:25:47.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.89,0:25:51.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.97,0:25:53.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手放头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands on your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.22,0:25:54.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.47,0:25:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不想伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want anyone to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.18,0:25:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动 听我们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down and listen to what we say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.89,0:26:01.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想让这件事尽量简单和平解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want this to go as simply and as peacefully as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.36,0:26:05.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去那边蹲着 安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down over there. Keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.11,0:26:10.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们搞出了很大动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we made a lot of noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.91,0:26:13.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们想尽快了事 这样你们就可以派人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to wrap this up quick so you can send people
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.41,0:26:15.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引开过来的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}to redirect anything coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.20,0:26:18.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塔拉说你们这片森林比较稀疏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tara said your forests are relatively clear,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.50,0:26:20.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们不会冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we won't take any chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.12,0:26:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何人都不必受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one needs to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.71,0:26:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要的只是你们有什么 我们需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just about what you have, what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.92,0:26:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人可以带走任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's taking anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.88,0:26:32.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to let everyone go
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.93,0:26:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.10,0:26:37.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开 不然她就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just walk away or this one dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.77,0:26:39.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我们会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.48,0:26:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们要带走你们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're taking your weapons with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.90,0:26:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点不变\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.73,0:26:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔尼亚是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Natania, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.23,0:26:48.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.74,0:26:51.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来谈谈我们可以改变什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let's talk about what we can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.57,0:26:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 马上离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Leave right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.99,0:26:57.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米恩琼 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.87,0:27:01.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是不想被打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wanna be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.33,0:27:02.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 我们会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.38,0:27:05.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立刻放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let go of her. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.42,0:27:09.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我们就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:11.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不想那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.51,0:27:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想让我们反抗救世军\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us to fight The Saviors.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.35,0:27:18.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们试过 输了 输得很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried that. We lost. Too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.89,0:27:20.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会再失去任何东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna lose anymore --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.52,0:27:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是我们的枪 还是我们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}not our guns, not our safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.90,0:27:25.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做了那么多 好不容易才来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}not after everything we've done to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.02,0:27:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna win
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.15,0:27:30.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有了你们的枪 无论你们帮不帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your guns, with or without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.28,0:27:38.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娜塔尼亚 放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Natania, put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.37,0:27:39.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了我 你也会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill me, and you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.54,0:27:43.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的人一样会拿走枪 什么都不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my people take the guns and nothing changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.30,0:27:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们应该试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should try.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.80,0:27:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祖母 住手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandma, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.72,0:27:55.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.01,0:27:57.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和他们谈谈吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just talk to them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.22,0:27:58.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.77,0:28:01.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.56,0:28:03.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've all forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.56,0:28:06.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们中有些人真的想反抗他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of you actually want to fight them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.36,0:28:07.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经历了那一切以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.19,0:28:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以丢掉枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can lose our guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.65,0:28:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们也要离开这里去战斗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but us leaving this place to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.24,0:28:14.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经历了那么多事以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.70,0:28:16.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须提醒你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to remind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.70,0:28:17.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.57,0:28:20.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会这样做 我会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gonna do this, and then I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.62,0:28:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这就有这么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.45,0:28:24.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你们的人生 你们所有人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your life, all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.29,0:28:26.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想它现在是什么样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.38,0:28:28.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想他们以前是怎么对我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what they did to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.34,0:28:29.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要看清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.46,0:28:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁眼好好看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.17,0:28:33.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克 有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick! Walkers!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.22,0:28:40.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.47,0:28:42.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让孩子们站到后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the children behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.06,0:28:43.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.06,0:28:44.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一班 跟他们站一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}First shift, join them on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.60,0:28:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拔刀 只杀行尸 只杀行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knives out. Dead only. Dead only!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.40,0:28:48.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪也别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.98,0:28:52.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人 距离10英尺以内再开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, shots within 10 feet of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.36,0:28:53.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.71,0:29:05.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.07,0:30:17.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们不会跟你们一起反抗他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We're not fighting them with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.86,0:30:20.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着你们的枪滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So take your damn guns and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.66,0:30:50.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.99,0:30:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.54,0:30:56.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.09,0:31:01.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫点人来 清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some people in here. Clean this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.27,0:31:15.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.27,0:31:17.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会真的以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't actually think
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.15,0:31:19.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你留着这把刀吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna let you keep this, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.36,0:31:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我相信你效忠之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still got a ways to go
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.86,0:31:27.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有很长一段路要走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I'll believe you're fully on board here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.16,0:31:29.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一步步来嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.66,0:31:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不是针对个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is absolutely not personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.54,0:31:35.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果情况调过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the situation was reversed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.33,0:31:37.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定也不会相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you wouldn't believe me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.67,0:31:39.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.17,0:31:43.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自救的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way you saved yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.46,0:31:47.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚向我投降的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way you surrendered to me just now --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.93,0:31:49.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个很好的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a damn good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.93,0:31:54.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 我们还得办点事 萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we got to work on some things, Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.35,0:31:58.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我向你保证 我会尽量让过程充满乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I promise you, I will try to make it fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.90,0:32:02.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实话说了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cards on the table...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.15,0:32:05.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一只小鸟告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little birdie told me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.74,0:32:09.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克和你们其他的人在动歪脑筋\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Rick and the rest of your people are up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.49,0:32:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这需要改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, that needs to change,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.95,0:32:15.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你要帮我改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna help me change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.00,0:32:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到一个双赢的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find us a win-win.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.79,0:32:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.71,0:32:22.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你打算…  - 我会给你找些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you  Hey, I'm gonna get you some stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.59,0:32:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你更舒适\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make you more comfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.92,0:32:27.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你体验一下我们能提供什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}let you have a taste of what it is we have to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.17,0:32:28.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好享受一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spend the night enjoying it,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.59,0:32:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.93,0:32:34.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna be a big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.62,0:33:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kal!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.26,0:33:53.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.97,0:33:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你开车带我去个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need you to drive me somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.14,0:33:58.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好打个包\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna want to pack a bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.65,0:34:05.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.40,0:34:07.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.19,0:34:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你愿意加入这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word in the halls is that you're all-in with things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.99,0:34:14.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在也许看起来不像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not seem like it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.32,0:34:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I assure you,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.70,0:34:17.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你同样做了正确的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}you, too, made the correct select.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.08,0:34:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.21,0:34:27.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.76,0:34:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.63,0:34:34.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been sitting here,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.64,0:34:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想着我怎么能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to figure out how I could,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.35,0:34:39.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了那么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}with what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.56,0:34:43.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的朋友们还在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}with our friends still out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.19,0:34:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还在被他们伤害着\N{\fnArial\fs30}still being hurt by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.19,0:34:48.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我怎么能那样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how I could've said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.57,0:34:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在 我陷入了绝境\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now...I am trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.91,0:34:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.86,0:34:57.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.41,0:34:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会帮你习惯现状\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you get used to the idea
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.16,0:35:02.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阐明利害 演示为什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and illustrate the equation and demonstrate why
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.75,0:35:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.08,0:35:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.08,0:35:09.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道如果我昨晚没杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew, if I didn't kill him last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.67,0:35:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.34,0:35:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没杀死他 所以就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't, so it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.97,0:35:16.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.26,0:35:20.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须给我搞些东西来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get me something --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.72,0:35:24.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀 枪 剃须刀片\N{\fnArial\fs30}a knife, a gun, a razor blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.52,0:35:25.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了尼根吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Negan?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.69,0:35:27.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.61,0:35:32.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 他都会利用我伤害我的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way or another, he is gonna use me to hurt my friends --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.19,0:35:34.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.24,0:35:39.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我对此无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there is nothing I can do about it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.24,0:35:42.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非我死了 不给他机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}except make sure I'm not alive to give him the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.87,0:35:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我被活捉 他就会伤害他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he has me, he will hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.92,0:35:48.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.79,0:35:50.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.17,0:35:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't  I-I don't think that
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.55,0:35:53.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你不会做任何事阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you won't do anything to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.38,0:35:54.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.46,0:35:57.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是求你了 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, please, Eugene...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.76,0:36:01.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让他们利用我伤害我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't let them use me to hurt our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.35,0:36:05.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 你必须给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, you have to give me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.06,0:36:09.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些东西了断自己 枪 刀 玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}something to stop this -- a gun, a knife, glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.60,0:36:10.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.73,0:36:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.28,0:36:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.99,0:36:20.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.20,0:36:21.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.17,0:36:30.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.99,0:37:03.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要全拿走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need all this, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.75,0:37:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.13,0:37:15.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是我杀的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just the ones I killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.05,0:37:19.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会想起我没杀的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think about the people I didn't kill, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.14,0:37:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束后我们会把枪送回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna bring them back when it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.77,0:37:36.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I want to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.78,0:37:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有些人想反抗 但不是所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us do, but not all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.03,0:37:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须达成共识 她们才会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it has to be all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.49,0:37:42.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我祖母认为你们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandmother thinks you'll all be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.41,0:37:44.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你祖母很多想法都是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, your grandmother's wrong about a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.16,0:37:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.08,0:37:47.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不想看见这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't want to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.08,0:37:49.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她躺下了 我把她打得挺重\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's lying down. I hit her pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.16,0:37:51.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你之前救我命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for saving my life before.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.42,0:37:53.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有另一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.33,0:37:55.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有另一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and then the other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.29,0:37:57.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许今天也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.50,0:37:58.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.63,0:38:03.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.26,0:38:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你所做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.14,0:38:13.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不给我们留一把枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not leaving us any?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.27,0:38:15.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不留 回见 瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. See ya later, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.94,0:38:22.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.36,0:38:24.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.86,0:38:25.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.12,0:38:28.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不必内疚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.96,0:38:51.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.79,0:38:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.46,0:39:01.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我仔细权衡考虑了上次谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given our last exchange a good, hard pro/con think.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.05,0:39:07.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我决定满足你的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've decided to grant your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.44,0:39:13.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用这个就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.69,0:39:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是毒药 本人亲手所做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a poison, homemade by yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.81,0:39:26.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摄入后20至\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will bring about certain death
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.45,0:39:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,30分钟内\N{\fnArial\fs30}in approximately 20 to 30 minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.05,0:39:30.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必死\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon the moment of ingestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.50,0:39:33.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信应该是无痛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to believe that it's painless.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.25,0:39:34.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not  I'm not certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.13,0:39:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做这个药是因为曾有人提过类似请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it at the behest of others for similar reasons,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.50,0:39:39.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来我发现她们给了我虚假信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}only it came to pass that they were feeding me the bum's steer,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.84,0:39:41.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我悬崖勒马\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I cut bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.51,0:39:45.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的不同之处是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The difference here is that
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.68,0:39:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩是长期旅伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and I have been long-time traveling companions,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.10,0:39:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你证明了自己是一个诚实勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have proven yourself to be honest, brave,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.27,0:39:51.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,具备完全自我意识的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and fully self-aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.48,0:39:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确信我欠你人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certain I owe you for things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.52,0:39:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我帮你找解脱办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me for a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.90,0:39:58.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had access to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.44,0:40:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先声明 我完全不希望你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record, I absolutely do not want you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.66,0:40:09.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是听起来你已经下了必死之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it sounds to me like you happen to be already gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.87,0:40:57.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.67,0:40:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨沙在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Sasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.21,0:41:04.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.66,0:41:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢点 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down. Come on. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.62,0:41:35.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他想帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says he wants to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.34,0:41:44.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That true?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.05,0:41:48.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.01,0:41:50.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.61,0:42:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.41,0:42:16.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:01.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》